<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>58.0</apiVersion>
    <assignments>
        <name>Clear_Ack_Routing</name>
        <label>Clear Acknowledgment Routing</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>134</locationY>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>$Record.Acknowledgment_Channel__c</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue></stringValue>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>$Record.Acknowledgment_Send_Mode__c</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue></stringValue>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>$Record.Acknowledgment_Template__c</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue></stringValue>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>$Record.Acknowledgment_Approved__c</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
    </assignments>
    <description>Before-save: when the DAF Gift flag is toggled on a gift that has not yet been acknowledged, clears the acknowledgment routing fields (Channel / Send Mode / Template) and un-approves it. Clearing Channel is what lets the after-save Acknowledgment Router re-classify the gift, because that router only fires while Channel is null - without this, a gift flagged as DAF *after* it was first routed would keep its standard, tax-language template. Approval is reset deliberately: a letter approved as a standard acknowledgment must not stay approved once it becomes a DAF acknowledgment. JSI-124 / Jason Ott.

Change Log:
-----------
2026-08-17 - Jason Ott - Created (JSI-124).</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>Opportunity Reset Ack On DAF Change {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Opportunity - Reset Acknowledgment On DAF Change</label>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <start>
        <locationX>50</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Clear_Ack_Routing</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterFormula>AND(
  ISCHANGED({!$Record.DAF_Gift__c}),
  NOT(ISPICKVAL({!$Record.npsp__Acknowledgment_Status__c}, &quot;Acknowledged&quot;))
)</filterFormula>
        <object>Opportunity</object>
        <recordTriggerType>Update</recordTriggerType>
        <triggerType>RecordBeforeSave</triggerType>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
</Flow>
